OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's George Square partially
OL,4,Areopens after major revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's landmark George Square has
OL,7,Fpartially reopened to the public after
OL,8,Fa major redevelopment.
OL,10,FWork to revamp the square began at the
OL,11,Fstart of 2025, with a water feature,
OL,12,Fraised lawn and sheltered seating among
OL,13,Fthe plans.
OL,15,FFencing on the western section of the
OL,16,Flandmark - next to Queen Street Station
OL,17,F- was removed on Friday, with work
OL,18,Fexpected to be completed by the end of
OL,19,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
